OL,3,GNEWSACity road still shut a year on
OL,4,Aamid 'mayhem'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA year after a major Birmingham city
OL,7,Fcentre road was closed over safety
OL,8,Ffears at a neighbouring tower block,
OL,9,Fdrivers say the disruption is still
OL,10,Fcausing "mayhem".
OL,12,FThe Suffolk Street slip road, from
OL,13,FNavigation Street leading to the A38
OL,14,FSuffolk Street Queensway, has been shut
OL,15,Fsince 8 October 2025 while work
OL,16,Fcontinues on the Orion Building's
OL,17,Ffacade.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
