OL,3,GNEWSACity road still shut a year on
OL,4,Aamid 'mayhem'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure followed concerns over
OL,7,Fabout 80 breeze blocks on the
OL,8,Fbuilding's eighth floor. Centrick,
OL,9,Fwhich manages Orion, says progress has
OL,10,Fbeen made and the road will reopen when
OL,11,Fit is safe to do so.
OL,13,FBut for delivery driver Shaun, the
OL,14,Fclosure is still causing "mayhem" 12
OL,15,Fmonths on.
